        "description": "Welcome to **Grimlord** - a Dark Fantasy Action Souls-like RPG built on Unreal Engine 5 for VR. Grimlord brings combat in VR like never before. You’re left to learn how to deal with them efficiently - for survival’s sake.\n{612261304678523}\n{1328467041485747}\nAwakened in a monastery deep in the Lonely Mountains, you walk in an epic quest as the adventurer standing before the darkness and striving for the light against the tyrannical Grim Lord.\n{936198914779981}\n{1262232681766791}\nWith a ton of unique enemies sprawling the monastery grounds capable of showing you their individual combat prowess.\n{2068537970254671}\n{997444575745152}\n\nAre you a battle-hardened sword & shield adventurer or a staff-wielding magic artist? Maybe a long-ranged bow & arrow assassin? How about an agile dual-wielding bladesman? Even go wild as a shield & dagger throwing specialist? The choice is yours, prisoner.\n{463209406558132}\n{460554790181263}\nWith boss battles meant to test your accumulated skills and knowledge, each encounter assures every prisoner’s adventure to strive for the light is as unique as it can be.\n\n{1507974639886234}\n\n\n\n{591821140265468}\n\n\n",
